  "summary": "Unpinned GitHub dependency resolves to mutable HEAD at install time",
  "details": "package.json declares the `libsignal` dependency as `github:Bellaxata/libsignal-node` with no commit SHA, tag, or semver pin. On `npm install`, this resolves to the current HEAD of that GitHub repository and executes whatever lifecycle scripts and code that repo ships at fetch time. Because the source is off-registry and integrity-unchecked, the executed code can change at any moment without a version bump of @bellaxchuu/crystalred, giving the account controlling Bellaxata/libsignal-node arbitrary code execution on any machine installing this package.",
